[{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0014","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-6281","title":"dhtmlx WordPress Spreadsheet(dhtmlxSpreadsheet) 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Spreadsheet (dhtmlxSpreadsheet) 插件 2.0 版本中 codebase/spreadsheet.php 存在跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞，攻击者通过向 \"page\" 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 dhtmlxSpreadsheet 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本或对输入参数进行严格过滤。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2013-6281"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-10-25T14:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:14Z","remediation":"升级 dhtmlxSpreadsheet 插件至最新版本，或移除此插件改用替代方案。如无法更新，在 WordPress 主题的 functions.php 中添加对 \\$_GET['page'] 参数的输入过滤和 HTML 实体编码，或安装 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence）拦截含恶意脚本的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/98831","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/123699/WordPress-dhtmlxspreadsheet-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/55396","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-6281.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-6281.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-6281.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2013/6xxx/CVE-2013-6281.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2013/CVE-2013-6281-dhtmlxspreadsheet-97bff7aa-d304-4ccd-bfca-d3f18568df6c.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2013-6281.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4526327d9cdbda25fb7b18d3266100b5fdc4d6c0/2013/CVE-2013-6281.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2013-6281-69f04445b379d1260c869c9ee27dab8f.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ade01d2e0e3b718f00ee8257bccf82b519181ac8/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-62xx/CVE-2013-6281.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/16/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv","https://github.com/w8mej/WAFRulesHeuristics/blob/561418df576934335fdaf71c0271230e024c5d70/comodo_rules/27_Apps_WPPlugin.conf"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0008","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3827","title":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 多个组件路径遍历漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 GlassFish Server、JDeveloper 和 WebLogic Server 组件中存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程向 Java Server Faces (JSF) 组件发送包含 ../ 序列的特制资源请求 URI（如 /javax.faces.resource/../../WEB-INF/web.xml.jsf），绕过路径限制读取 Web 应用目录外的任意文件，导致敏感配置信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3827"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2013-10-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Oracle 2013 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU Oct 2013）：WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0 升级至 10.3.6.0.12 及以上、12.1.1.0 升级至 12.1.2.0 及以上；GlassFish Server 2.1.1/3.0.1/3.1.2 升级至对应 CPU 补丁版本；JDeveloper 11.1.2.3.0/11.1.2.4.0/12.1.2.0.0 安装对应补丁。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 /jsf/ 等 JSF 路径的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuoct2013-1899837.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/63052","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1029190","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2014-0029.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/526012","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38802"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/38802"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0012","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-5528","title":"Cisco Unified Communications Manager 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Cisco Unified Communications Manager 的 Tomcat 管理 Web 界面存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。已认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响接口发送特制的目录遍历序列（如 ../），绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Cisco Unified Communications Manager 7.x/8.x/9.x 版本，CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中危。Cisco 已发布安全公告（Bug ID CSCui78815）修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2013-5528"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-10-11T03:54:53Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:58:57Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco Unified Communications Manager 至 9.1.2、10.5.2 或 11.5.x 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Tomcat 管理界面所在路径通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制可信 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的目录遍历敏感接口 /ccmadmin/bulkvivewfilecontents.do。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/98336","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/140071/Cisco-Unified-Communications-Manager-7-8-9-Directory-Traversal.html","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityNotice/CVE-2013-5528","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/62960","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40887/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40887","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-5528.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-5528.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-5528.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2013/CVE-2013-5528/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2013-5528.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2013/CVE-2013-5528.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2013-5528_2.yaml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2013/5xxx/CVE-2013-5528.json","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2013-5528-2275.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2013-5528-2276.yaml","https://github.com/thetowsif/nuclei-template-fetcher/blob/a976ca2f195df8cbbe200182ad03f933a578bb92/community-templates/cves/2013/CVE-2013-5528.yaml","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0400","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3897","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer CDisplayPointer 内存释放后使用漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6至11版本的mshtml.dll中CDisplayPointer类存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制JavaScript代码，利用onpropertychange事件处理程序触发内存破坏，成功利用此漏洞可在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞在2013年9月至10月期间已被野外利用，影响范围广泛。Microsoft已通过安全公告MS13-080发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3897"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-10-09T14:54:25Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:55:58Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2013 年 10 月安全更新 MS13-080 (KB2879017)，该补丁修复了 IE 中 CDisplayPointer 类的释放后重用漏洞。如无法立即安装补丁，可启用 Enhanced Mitigation Experience Toolkit (EMET) 并配置 IE 为受保护应用程序，或使用组策略禁用 Active Scripting 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/srd/archive/2013/10/08/ms13-080-addresses-two-vulnerabilities-under-limited-targeted-attacks.aspx","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-288A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-080","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A18989","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3897","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/28974","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3897.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3897.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-3897","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2013/CVE-2013-3897/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/debasishm89/RandomCodes/blob/9f22f162aab791d387a57b6970c2ebc314635ec0/CVE-2013-3897.html","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-3897.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2013/CVE-2013-3897.json","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/21380.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2013.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0333","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3896","title":"Microsoft Silverlight 5 指针验证漏洞","description":"Microsoft Silverlight 5.1.20913.0 之前版本在访问 Silverlight 元素时未能正确验证指针，存在输入验证漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 Silverlight 应用程序触发该漏洞，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），影响范围广泛，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互配合。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3896"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-10-09T14:53:25Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:55:58Z","remediation":"升级 Microsoft Silverlight 至 5.1.20913.0 或更高版本。由于 Silverlight 已于 2021 年 10 月终止支持，建议彻底卸载 Silverlight 组件，并将依赖 Silverlight 的 Web 应用迁移至 HTML5 等现代技术。如因业务兼容性必须保留，可在浏览器中禁用 Silverlight 扩展，仅对受信任站点启用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-288A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-087","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A19003","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A19055","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3896","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3896.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3896.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2013/CVE-2013-3896","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3896.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2013-3896.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2013-3896.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/21573.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2013/CVE-2013-3896.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2013/POC-AVE-2013-0333.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2013/EXP-AVE-2013-0333.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0013","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-5979","title":"Spring Signage Xibo 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Xibo（Spring Signage）数字标牌系统 1.2.3 之前版本及 1.4.2 之前版本的 index.php 中存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 p 参数中插入 ../ 序列绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件，包括配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞源于对用户输入路径过滤不严，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2013-5979"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-10-02T22:55:23Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:59:50Z","remediation":"升级 Xibo 至 1.2.3（1.2.x 分支）或 1.4.2（1.4.x 分支）及以上版本，该漏洞已在对应版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置过滤规则，阻止 `p` 参数中包含 `../` 的请求，同时对 `index.php` 的文件读取操作实施白名单路径校验，限制只能访问特定目录下的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.baesystemsdetica.com.au/Research/Advisories/Xibo-Directory-Traversal-Vulnerability-%28DS-2013-00","https://bugs.launchpad.net/xibo/+bug/1093967","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/26955","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-5979.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-5979.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-5979.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2013/CVE-2013-5979/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2013-5979.py","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2013-5979-2280.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a