sec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0002","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-1965","title":"Apache Struts2 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 的 Showcase 示例应用存在远程命令执行漏洞（S2-012），攻击者可通过向参数重定向功能提交特制的恶意参数名，触发 OGNL 表达式注入，从而在服务器端执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Struts 2.0.0 至 2.3.13 版本（部分来源称至 2.3.14.2），CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向受影响应用发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，可能导致服务器被完全控制。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2013-1965"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2013-07-10T19:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:52:29Z","remediation":"将 Apache Struts2 升级至 2.3.14.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 struts.xml 中禁用动态方法调用（设置 struts.enable.DynamicMethodInvocation=false）并严格校验用户输入参数名，避免包含 OGNL 特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://struts.apache.org/development/2.x/docs/s2-012.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/60082","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=967655","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-1965.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-1965.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2013/CVE-2013-1965.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2013/CVE-2013-1965.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2013-1965-2231.yaml","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/Apache%20Struts/%EF%BC%88CVE-2013-1965%EF%BC%89s2-012.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2013-1965-2230.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2013/CVE-2013-1965/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2013/database/CVE-2013-1965/CVE-2013-1965-cinno.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog-pocs/blob/253291be2d307a6c836d5997bbb838f1e846f9ba/CVE/2013/CVE-2013-1965.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/14d36cd646300e9b9b8fa1a2222524533239a69b/data/cve-2013-1965-2227.yaml","https://github.com/cinno/CVE-2013-1965"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2013/AVE-2013-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2013-0300","file_name":"2013/AVE-2013-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2013-3163","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 8至10版本存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网站触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞源于IE对内存对象处理不当导致越界写入，攻击无需身份认证但需用户交互。Microsoft已在安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2013-3163"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2013-07-10T03:46:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:54:37Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS13-055 提供的累积安全更新 2846071，该更新通过修改 Internet Explorer 处理内存中对象的方式修复此漏洞。Windows 用户可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。由于该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录且 Internet Explorer 已停止支持，建议仍在使用 IE 的组织尽快升级到基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 浏览器，并在过渡期间启用增强安全配置（ESC）限制 IE 访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA13-190A","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2013/ms13-055","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17363","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2013-3163","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2013/CVE-2013-3163.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2013/3xxx/CVE-2013-3163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0